# Licensing of this image subset

This file covers the 14 images currently shipped in `data/public_subset/`. Every one of
them originates from a museum open-access programme and is released under **CC0 1.0
Universal**, which places the work in the public domain and permits reuse without
attribution.

## 1. `02_museum_Cleveland_CC0/`

The Cleveland Museum of Art. Dedicated to the public domain under **CC0 1.0 Universal**:
<https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/>

## 2. `03_museum_Harvard_no_permission_required/`

Harvard Art Museums. The museum's public API reports an image permission level of zero
for these objects, denoting that the images are supplied without a permission
requirement. The objects are of the Warring States period and therefore in the public
domain. The credit line specified in `CREDITS.md` should be reproduced.

## 3. `04_museum_NMAA_Smithsonian_CC0/`

National Museum of Asian Art, Smithsonian Institution. Released under **CC0** in
accordance with the museum's Image Services policy:
<https://asia.si.edu/research/research-resources/image-services-and-permissions/>

## 4. Author field photographs — not currently included

Ten field photographs are **not** part of this release, because their rights status is
not yet settled. No licence is asserted over them here.

If they are added later, this file must be updated to state their actual rights basis and
the corresponding licence section, and the statements in `README.md`, `CREDITS.md`,
`SOURCES.csv` and `CITATION.cff` must be brought into agreement with it. Under no
circumstances should they be released under a Creative Commons licence unless the
copyright holder has granted that licence.

## 5. Other material not included

Photographs taken by the authors inside museum galleries, and photographs obtained from
museum websites or from excavation reports and catalogues, are not included in this
subset because their rights status is not settled. They are reproduced in the article
for scholarly citation, comparison and criticism only.

## 6. Scope of this licence

This file licenses the **images only**. It does not apply to the source code in the rest
of this repository, which is covered by a separate licence (see the repository root).

## 7. No warranty

The images are provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. Users are responsible for
verifying that their intended reuse complies with the applicable licence.
